{
  "name": "02 Sales page visitor → abandoned checkout recovery",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 02 Abandoned checkout recovery\nRazorpay Payment Buttons don't emit a 'checkout started' event, so the sales page should POST `{ name, email, phone }` here when the visitor clicks **Pay** (or submits a pre-checkout form).\n\nFlow: wait 60 min → read **Purchases** tab (filled by workflow 03) → if no match → WhatsApp reminder (MARKETING template `checkout_reminder`, vars: {{1}} name, {{2}} link).\n\nOnly message people who gave their number on your form and consented.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 480
      },
      "id": "e2b79d38-9957-5d7c-80d5-27a292113876",
      "name": "Setup notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "checkout-started",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
